{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself stranded in a hostile world. Everything here seems to want you dead. Embark on a journey through this dangerous world to get back to your home world.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 levels: </strong>Main game consists of 100 levels. The levels are designed to be short but challenging. The whole level is visible to you at all times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 boss levels:</strong> Each chapter consists of 20 levels, at the end of the chapter you'll encounter a boss level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonus content:</strong> There's 40 optional bonus levels waiting for you. If you're seeking an extra challenge make sure to visit these levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard difficulty:</strong> The levels get more and more challenging as you progress. Your skills will be tested.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deathcounter:</strong> At the end of every chapter you'll see your total deathcount. It's probably going to be a big number.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamepad support:</strong> Although keyboard is supported, gamepad is recommended.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay showcase:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481470/extras/d5280428eaa51c1c222c5caf5aed6988.poster.avif?t=1762852761\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481470/extras/d5280428eaa51c1c222c5caf5aed6988.webm?t=1762852761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st